    },
    {
      "id": "node-040",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Proxy Cost 排名**\nexp(2·V_rel)·(hpwl/ha + area/aa)\n錨點跟候選池無關",
      "x": 2310,
      "y": 660,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-050",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Portfolio 選擇\n每個候選都算 proxy cost，逐案挑最低者送出",
