    },
    {
      "id": "node-001",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Electro Pipeline v20\n**生產預設** Neutral=1.3260, REAL=0.9987, 100/100 合法, 99/100 快過中位數",
      "x": -20,
      "y": -480,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 120,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-031",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "⚡ **FAST_CLEANUP**\n真實 Total −12.2%\n快過中位數 43→95 案",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": -410,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 140,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-021",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**LP 位移最小化**\n`ELECTRO_LP_DISPLACEMENT=1`\nLP 式最小位移 legalize\n獨立額外候選",
      "x": 2535,
      "y": 380,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-010",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 1: analytical_place()\nAdam 梯度下降 300 步\n+ MIB_ANCHOR_SNAP（訓練中引導）\n+ MIB_ANCHOR（輸出前對齊）",
      "x": 640,
      "y": -75,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-011",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 2a: legalize()\n順序抽取 → 壓實 → cleanup\n⚡ FAST_CLEANUP (2.4×)",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": -30,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-072",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Per-RMAP 可行性（負面）**\n交替投影 + 擾動\n20 案 V_rel 變差 28.2%\n慢 33 倍，15 輪內未收斂",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-074",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**對偶上升 boundary ✅ 已納入生產預設**\nELECTRO_DUAL_ASCENT_BND=1 K=40\n（v19無此程式碼，之前設了無聲失效）\n獨立量測：Neutral 1.3642→1.3612, Vbnd 164→133",
      "x": 950,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-071",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**L-BFGS 打磨（負面）**\nfrac≥0.7 凍結所有 schedule\n3 個切換點全部更慢 (3.35-6.54×)\n品質也更差",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 580,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-073",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**ADMM 邊界（負面）**\n有號殘差增廣拉格朗日\n20 案 Neutral 變差 8.1%\nVgrp/Vmib/Vbnd 全部變差",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-060",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 2b: slice_pack()\nGuillotine 遞迴切割\n+ SLICE_ALIGN_PORTFOLIO\n兩種方向都保留成候選",
      "x": 1220,
      "y": 260,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 200,
      "color": "2"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-012",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Stage 3: soft_repair()\nboundary snap + wide-swap\ngrouping push-past",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": -10,
      "width": 380,
      "height": 160,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-033",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**已測不採用**\nSLICE_WALLS / BUDGET / ...",
      "x": 1800,
      "y": -220,
      "width": 400,
      "height": 100,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "node-004",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**Dirichlet 調和延拓初始化**\n生產預設（取代舊 Jacobi）\n`ELECTRO_DIRICHLET_INIT=1`\nGraph Laplacian 封閉解\n全 100 案 Neutral 1.4018→1.3776 (-1.73%)",
      "x": 10,
      "y": -60,
